    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Falling through the endless abyss...&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Five Minutes... 2 Years? I don't know how long it's been...&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;What if I never stop falling...&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game to end ALL games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Hole Sim Remix is a ONCE IN A LIFETIME experience, fall down a hole, and keep falling FOREVER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Hole Sim Remix, only $80... I mean $120... I mean $6.99<i>usd</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A remix of a once in a lifetime experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Hole Sim Remix has been remixed to offer a better experience over the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changes over the original</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Lore Accurate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely Remade Map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better Jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Boxes (definitely working)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gacha Mechanics (also definitely working)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fall down hole FOREVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and fall forever. You NEVER get to come out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why you may ask? Well because we CAN! Can you all through into the Under-Realm and escape the town stuck out of time? You'll find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full RPG-combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs to help tell the unique story we want to tell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ingame locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A definitely infinite hole that'll DEFENITELY never end.</p></li></ul>",
